{"id":"vod_sn_37840","vodId":"37840","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"苏生龙王传说","name_cn":"苏生龙王传说","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/83e6b1eea7256c7e00554c593765e35f.jpg"},"summary":"在未来的世界，高科技的玩具开发为小孩带来无尽的快乐与烦恼。社会在科技中变幻……　　根据古代文献的记载,总共有81种拥有各种强有力能力的生物被封印在soul doll中,为了能得到它们的力量,DWC公司研制了Legendz,它能成功的召唤出被封印在soul doll中的生物,并做为一种新型的娱乐游戏Legendzbattl向全世界推广.当然,游戏中能召唤出来的都是虚拟的……　　DWC公司根据古代文献的地图找到了soul doll的所在地,但只发现了77种.能力最为强大的四属性(风,火,地,水)龙的soul doll却不在其中……　　一年后,风龙出现,他找了那传说中的风的使者---修.风龙的出现立刻引起DWC公司（黑暗天才公司）的注意,为了能得到风龙的soul doll,他们也派出了众多的soul doll……因此引发出一连串的笑话!","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KHVTqw6Rw21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gAjaTtYSbN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CA5ZtjQpPv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mB19T4biGg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HU3fnuq8261/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sMrddmhkT61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9AsDmYvMtE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HpMh3ienTg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0t1e4nENmS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GJeDbWPcH71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TLRDTRFbaz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YFerc5W2rV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y512JAGGsd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14